    "  2024 Gangnam Medi Tour Festa    A chance to meet healthy beauty just for you at Gangnam Medi Tour Festa!    Gangnam Medi Tour Festaheld throughout the month of September!    Please provide information to international medical tourists:)            [MEDI SALE] : A chance for you to meet world-class medical technology at discounted prices    Schedule: Sep. 1, 2024 (Sun) Sep. 30, 2024 (Mon)    Participating Organizations: Medical tourism partners participating in MEDI SALE (see list in the website)    Eligibility: International medical tourists        【How to Participate】    1) Visit the Gangnam MediTour Festa website ;    2) Select the desired department and hospital under the Medi Sale tab;    3) Download discount coupons for your favorite hospital and make an appointment.        [POP-UP ZONE] : Enjoyment with various medical tourism information and experiences    Schedule: Sep. 7, 2024 (Sat) Sep. 8, 2024 (Sun) 10 AM 7 PM [2 days]    Venue: COEX East Plaza (opposite Gangnam Style Wrist Statue)    Eligibility: International medical tourists and general tourists        【Programs】    1) Pop-up store: Beauty products recommended by famous dermatological and plastic surgeons on sale at discounted prices    2) Medical device experience: Experience skin measurement, scalp and eye care devices    3) Experience event: Welcome drink, Tea that suits you, with traditional costume experience and photo zone        [ENJOY GMTC] : Enjoy Gangnam Medical Tour Center, the hub of medical tourism in Korea    1. Medical Talk Show (with K-Doc)    Schedule: Sep. 12, 2024 (Thu) 3 PM 4 PM    Venue: Gangnam Medical Tour Center    Eligibility: Up to 20 international tourists    Topic: Introduction of the latest trending K-beauty plastic surgery        2. K-Culture Program    Schedule: Every Thu 2 PM 3 PM, Sep. 2024    Venue: Gangnam Medical Tour Center    How to participate: Online reservation        【Programs】    1) Making Plaster Air Freshener: Sep. 5, 2024 (Thu) 2 PM 3 PM    2) Make Y